# Zoraline, Cosmos Caller: "you may pay {W}{B} and 2 life". The life is judged as it is paid (CR 119.4), after the mana
# abilities activated while paying (CR 605.3a): at 2 life Bot1 is offered the payment, makes its {W} with Mana Confluence
# ("{T}, Pay 1 life"), and is left with 1 life - too little for the 2. The payment can no longer be made: paying is no
# longer offered, only declining, though the pool covers the mana. The life stays at 1, no reflexive trigger, the Ornithopter stays in the graveyard and the {W}{B} stays in the pool.
# The positive control is the same at 3 life (zoraline-paid-with-mana-confluence-at-3-life-...).

